# Canonical author identity for this repository.
#
# git reads this file for log, shortlog, blame and anything else that prints an
# author, so `git shortlog -sne` collapses to one name without rewriting a
# single commit. Committed history stays byte-identical; only its presentation
# changes. Format: <canonical name> <canonical email> <matched name> <matched email>
Serhii Zolotov <zolotov.98@gmail.com> greenblacked <zolotov.98@gmail.com>
